1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:04,720
You were ordered to leave Barnham alive,
and you disobeyed that order.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,780
Jamie had to believe
I was capable of anything.

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,280
He had to take me to the JBA.

4
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:15,510
First up was the man in charge,
Emile Dufraisne.

5
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,580
I remembered him from Iceland.

6
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,320
Next was his lieutenant, Carson Moss.

7
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,840
Can't say we hit it off.

8
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:28,360
The person who was going to handle
the weapon was Enrica Villablanca.

9
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,860
She wasn't much older than my daughter.

10
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,730
And finally there was BJ Sykes,

11
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,620
the techie in charge
of their security systems.

12
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,830
One man I didn't get to meet
was Cole Yeagher.

13
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:44,000
It seems Dufraisne was afraid Yeagher
was plotting to take over the JBA.

14
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,970
So he sent me on an errand
to pump Yeagher for information,

15
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,340
hoping Yeagher might try
to get the new recruit on his side.

16
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,210
On my way to see Yeagher,
I had an opportunity to sneak

17
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,600
into the compound's restricted area,
so I took it.
